---
// src/components/MethodologyNote.astro
---

<div class="methodology-card card">
  <div class="methodology-badge-row">
    <span class="trust-badge">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
        <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
      </svg>
      <span>TokuPrice Data Integrity Standard</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="methodology-title">Statistical Aggregation &amp; Compliance Policy</h3>

  <div class="methodology-grid">
    <div class="grid-col">
      <div class="col-icon">📊</div>
      <div class="col-content">
        <h4>100% Aggregated Secondary Statistics</h4>
        <p>
          Prices represent mathematical medians, rolling 30-day velocity, and interquartile distributions. We calculate fair market values to protect collectors from arbitrary reseller markups.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-col">
      <div class="col-icon">🛡️</div>
      <div class="col-content">
        <h4>Zero Scraped Media or Seller Text</h4>
        <p>
          We strictly do NOT scrape, hotlink, or republish third-party user photos, auction titles, or seller descriptions from Japanese marketplaces. All product taxonomy maps strictly to official catalog metadata.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-col">
      <div class="col-icon">🧹</div>
      <div class="col-content">
        <h4>Automated Outlier &amp; Junk-Lot Stripping</h4>
        <p>
          Our classification algorithms automatically detect and exclude multi-item junk lots (まとめ売り), candy toy mini-variants (Shokugan), bootleg copies, and box-only listings from functional medians.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-col">
      <div class="col-icon">🇯🇵</div>
      <div class="col-content">
        <h4>5-Platform Primary Market Reality</h4>
        <p>
          Transaction records originate directly from Tokyo’s primary secondary trading pools: Mercari Japan, Yahoo! Auctions Japan, Rakuma, Mandarake, and Suruga-ya.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="methodology-footer">
    <a href="/methodology/" class="footer-link">
      <span>Read full mathematical methodology &amp; validation rules</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .methodology-card {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background-color: var(--surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .trust-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--state-success);
    background-color: var(--state-success-surface);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
    border-radius: var(--rounded-pill);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .methodology-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .methodology-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .grid-col {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }

  .col-icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 0.125rem;
  }

  .col-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .col-content h4 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .col-content p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .methodology-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    padding-top: 0.875rem;
  }

  .footer-link {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--action-primary);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }

  .footer-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .methodology-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
